# Cline workspace rules for Lyra
- Use local-v1 at http://127.0.0.1:4040. Do not call hosted LLM APIs.
- GHOST-HAND detailed mode is the default optimizer protocol.
- GitHub Actions and GitHub MCP are removed; use Cloudflare dry-run scripts.
- Never wrangler deploy without --dry-run.
- Black's Law Dictionary is not shipped; use FOLIO plus the public-domain glossary.
- CJIS/NCIC credentials are placeholders only. Do not send live NCIC queries.
- YOLO / Auto-Run is disabled. Ask before destructive commands.
